---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Read how The Elite Spa Centre website handles booking enquiries, WhatsApp hand-off and browser-saved product cart information."
>
  <main id="main-content">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>Appointment forms are processed in your browser and open WhatsApp with the details you entered. This website does not send booking-form data to its own server or store submitted booking details.</p>
    <p>The product enquiry cart may save product names, indicative prices and quantities in your browser's local storage so the cart can remain available when you return to this website on the same browser. This cart information is stored on your device, not in a website order database. You can clear it using the Clear cart control on the shop page or by clearing this website's browser storage.</p>
    <p>Information you choose to send to the spa through WhatsApp or by phone is handled by those services and the spa to respond to enquiries and coordinate appointments or product enquiries. Review the applicable service privacy information before sharing details.</p>
    <p>Do not submit sensitive medical, identity or financial information through this website or an ordinary WhatsApp enquiry. No online payment is collected on this website.</p>
  </main>
</Base>
